O|
S|       9       INT. JACKSON DEMOCRATIC CLUB. KANSAS CITY - DAY (1925)         9     
N|               It is 1925.                                                          
O|
N,G|               The place is full of members of the Moskowitz clan. We PAN           
N,G,I|               PAST THEM to the back, where Patrick Milligan (we recognize          
N,I|               the cap), now 12, sneaks past the guards and OPENS THE BACK          
N|               DOOR -- letting in A DOZEN IRISH MEN with TOMMY GUNS.                
O|
G|               CLOSE UP ON YOUNG PATRICK                                            
O|
N,G|               The tattered CAP from his youth almost fits him now. We PUSH         
N,G|               IN ON HIM as the men move past him, just dark blurs. He looks        
N|               nervous, but also filled with a rightness of purpose.                
G|               ANGLE ON THE CLUB                                                    
O|
N|               as the Irish OPEN FIRE on the MOSKOWITZ CONTINGENCY. It’s a          
N|               massacre.                                                            
O|
G|               CLOSE UP ON PATRICK                                                  
O|
N,I,G|               flinching at the gunfire. A MAN steps into frame. The CAMERA         
N,G|               RISES. It’s Yiddles. He pats Patrick on the head.                    
O|
C|                                   YIDDLES                                          
U|                         Well done, boyo.                                           
N|               Patrick beams. He has spent 5 years living in a stranger’s           
N|               family, dreaming of coming home.                                     
O|
C,E|                                   YIDDLES (CONT'D)                                 
P|                             (call out)                                             
U|                         Bring the lad.                                             
O|
N,I|               TWO MEN drag 16-year-old Ari Moskowitz into the club. He is          
N|               bleeding from the nose, his left eye swollen shut.                   
O|
C,E|                                   YIDDLES (CONT'D)                                 
U|                         And now, my son, are ya familiar                           
U|                         with the legend a Goldilocks?                              
N|               The men throw Ari to the floor. Yiddles puts a foot on him.          
O|
C,E|                                   YIDDLES (CONT'D)                                 
U|                         Someone’s been sittin in yer chair.                        
U|                         Someone’s been eatin’ from yer                             
U|                         bowl. Someone’s been sleepin’ in                           
U|                         yer bed.                                                   
O|
N|               He hands Patrick a REVOLVER.                                         
O|
C,E|                                   YIDDLES (CONT'D)                                 
U|                         Time for bears to be bears.                                
O|
